{"id":"wb-7-525","name":"山王墓地","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"山王墓地","text":"山王墓地位于中国山西省运城市河津市柴家乡山王村西泰山庙地，是一处全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n2013年3月5日，山王墓地公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，古墓葬类，年代为西周，编号7-0525。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E7%8E%8B%E5%A2%93%E5%9C%B0","revisionId":89626805,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89626805","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null,"textScope":"body-excerpt"}